{"4778600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wobble Bros", "steam_appid": 4778600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5116810], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/abf046329e9edb21528a65115bdf7069.poster.avif?t=1787337684\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/abf046329e9edb21528a65115bdf7069.webm?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/abf046329e9edb21528a65115bdf7069.mp4?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Wobble Bros is a chaotic co-op physics game where you and your friends play as clumsy ragdoll doctors carrying a helpless ragdoll patient on a stretcher through dangerous rescue routes. Every step, bump, and jump can send your whole team tumbling, so staying upright together is half the challenge—and most of the comedy. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/c8781353044ae0e545b03b4254968022.poster.avif?t=1787337684\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/c8781353044ae0e545b03b4254968022.webm?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/c8781353044ae0e545b03b4254968022.mp4?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in 2-player co-op with one stretcher and two doctors, or join 4-player chaos with two stretcher teams and four ragdoll doctors. Work together, recover from ridiculous accidents, and try to reach the evac point before physics turns your rescue into a disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/a0f1e1c42411ce4ffb1e4aefd52e4aa4.poster.avif?t=1787337684\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/a0f1e1c42411ce4ffb1e4aefd52e4aa4.webm?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/a0f1e1c42411ce4ffb1e4aefd52e4aa4.mp4?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2- or 4-player co-op with physics-driven ragdoll doctors and patient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate your movements while carrying the patient through dangerous courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable rescue levels packed with chaos, laughter, and “one more try” moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer for couch co-op or remote play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, cartoony, family-friendly slapstick with zero gore and maximum mess</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/abf046329e9edb21528a65115bdf7069.poster.avif?t=1787337684\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/abf046329e9edb21528a65115bdf7069.webm?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/abf046329e9edb21528a65115bdf7069.mp4?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Wobble Bros is a chaotic co-op physics game where you and your friends play as clumsy ragdoll doctors carrying a helpless ragdoll patient on a stretcher through dangerous rescue routes. Every step, bump, and jump can send your whole team tumbling, so staying upright together is half the challenge—and most of the comedy. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/c8781353044ae0e545b03b4254968022.poster.avif?t=1787337684\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/c8781353044ae0e545b03b4254968022.webm?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/c8781353044ae0e545b03b4254968022.mp4?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in 2-player co-op with one stretcher and two doctors, or join 4-player chaos with two stretcher teams and four ragdoll doctors. Work together, recover from ridiculous accidents, and try to reach the evac point before physics turns your rescue into a disaster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/a0f1e1c42411ce4ffb1e4aefd52e4aa4.poster.avif?t=1787337684\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/a0f1e1c42411ce4ffb1e4aefd52e4aa4.webm?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4778600/extras/a0f1e1c42411ce4ffb1e4aefd52e4aa4.mp4?t=1787337684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_parag